    "body": "I think the git status wsl feature should to be changed to forward all config paths from `$STARSHIP_CONFIG`. Adding `l` to the `WSLENV` parameters for the variable should translate the list to the Windows syntax (`;`). It might be possible to only check for the existence of the `$STARSHIP_CONFIG` variable there instead of parsing it and conditionally set it to `/dev/null` if it doesn't, assuming it gets inherited properly (needs testing).",
